WEBVTT

00:00:16.019 --> 00:00:17.395
[roars]

00:00:18.229 --> 00:00:19.856
[all roaring]

00:00:21.357 --> 00:00:22.859
[people cheering]

00:00:25.236 --> 00:00:27.864
You never cease to amaze me, bud.

00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:30.200
Thank you.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.327
[all laughing]

00:00:33.036 --> 00:00:35.747
Toothless, you know that doesn't wash out!

00:00:38.208 --> 00:00:40.043
[man] I knew you'd come back!

00:00:42.921 --> 00:00:43.922
[Astrid] Stormfly!

00:00:45.882 --> 00:00:46.925
[laughs]

00:00:47.008 --> 00:00:49.469
Oh, give me a cuddle, Grumpy!

00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:51.262
[groans]

00:00:51.554 --> 00:00:53.056
[chuckles]

00:00:53.139 --> 00:00:54.766
Who's my little princess?

00:00:54.849 --> 00:00:56.726
Don't you ever leave again, Hookfang.

00:00:56.851 --> 00:00:59.270
You are! Yes, you are! I missed you!

00:00:59.521 --> 00:01:00.647
Oh, Barf!

00:01:00.814 --> 00:01:02.440
Not you!

00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:08.071
That was some pretty fine
dragon wrangling back there.

00:01:08.279 --> 00:01:09.906
You'd make a good trapper.

00:01:09.989 --> 00:01:11.491
Whoa! [chuckles]

00:01:11.574 --> 00:01:14.452
You know, Skullcrusher's
gonna need somebody

00:01:14.536 --> 00:01:16.079
to look after him now.

00:01:16.621 --> 00:01:17.622
Me?

00:01:21.918 --> 00:01:23.086
I'd be honored.

00:01:25.296 --> 00:01:29.259
Your father would be
every bit as proud as I am.

00:01:29.384 --> 00:01:30.927
[chuckles] Thank you.

00:01:31.094 --> 00:01:32.971
I'm really glad you're here, Mom.

00:01:33.137 --> 00:01:35.139
And here I'll stay.

00:01:36.641 --> 00:01:38.017
See?

00:01:38.184 --> 00:01:39.811
I told you it was in here.

00:01:40.311 --> 00:01:41.938
[all laughing]

00:01:42.021 --> 00:01:45.024
Still doing that one? That's hilarious.

00:01:45.191 --> 00:01:46.609
Come here, you.

00:01:46.693 --> 00:01:47.694
Mmm.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:48.861
Ooh!

00:02:19.309 --> 00:02:21.561
The chief has come home!

00:02:21.644 --> 00:02:23.229
[all cheering]

00:02:28.192 --> 00:02:30.445
[all chanting] Long live the chief!

00:02:30.528 --> 00:02:34.657
Long live the chief! Long live the chief!

00:02:47.545 --> 00:02:49.005
[Snotlout exclaiming] Yeah!

00:02:49.547 --> 00:02:50.757
[grunts]

00:02:51.215 --> 00:02:52.216
Ah. [gasps]

00:02:53.843 --> 00:02:55.053
[Snotlout exclaiming]

00:02:55.845 --> 00:02:57.221
[all cheering]

00:02:59.599 --> 00:03:01.476
[Hiccup] This is Berk.

00:03:02.393 --> 00:03:04.771
A bit trampled and busted
and covered in ice,

00:03:04.937 --> 00:03:06.689
but it's home.

00:03:06.856 --> 00:03:08.441
It's our home.

00:03:09.859 --> 00:03:11.736
[people talking indistinctly]

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.948
[Hiccup] Those who attacked us
are relentless and crazy.

00:03:16.324 --> 00:03:18.117
But those who stopped them,

00:03:18.201 --> 00:03:20.620
oh, even more so!

00:03:20.745 --> 00:03:22.288
[Astrid laughing]

00:03:23.373 --> 00:03:25.416
[Hiccup] We may be small in numbers,

00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:26.959
but we stand for something

00:03:27.043 --> 00:03:30.296
bigger than anything
the world can pit against us.

00:03:31.381 --> 00:03:33.549
We are the voice of peace.

00:03:33.716 --> 00:03:36.719
And, bit by bit,
we will change this world.

00:03:36.928 --> 00:03:38.304
[sheep bleating]

00:03:42.058 --> 00:03:43.226
[gasps]

00:03:45.937 --> 00:03:48.439
[Hiccup] You see, we have
something they don't.

00:03:48.773 --> 00:03:51.984
Oh, sure, they have armies,
and they have armadas,

00:03:52.068 --> 00:03:53.486
but we…

00:03:53.569 --> 00:03:55.655
We have…

00:03:57.281 --> 00:03:59.033
Our dragons!

00:03:59.117 --> 00:04:00.451
[roars]

00:04:02.036 --> 00:04:03.663
♪ Let the wind carry us ♪

00:04:03.746 --> 00:04:06.499
♪ To the clouds, hurry up, all right ♪

00:04:08.668 --> 00:04:10.545
♪ We can travel so far ♪

00:04:10.628 --> 00:04:13.923
♪ As our eyes can see ♪

00:04:15.717 --> 00:04:21.681
♪ We go where no one goes ♪

00:04:22.515 --> 00:04:26.394
♪ We slow for no one ♪

00:04:26.477 --> 00:04:28.271
♪ Get out… ♪

00:04:28.354 --> 00:04:31.107
♪ …of our way ♪

00:04:55.381 --> 00:04:57.008
♪ Awake in the sky ♪

00:04:57.091 --> 00:04:59.844
♪ We break up so high, all right ♪

00:05:02.096 --> 00:05:03.806
♪ Let's make it our own ♪

00:05:04.015 --> 00:05:06.851
♪ Let's savor it ♪

00:05:08.895 --> 00:05:13.983
♪ We go where no one goes ♪

00:05:14.066 --> 00:05:17.945
♪ We slow for no one ♪

00:05:19.614 --> 00:05:23.618
♪ Get out of our way ♪

00:05:43.137 --> 00:05:48.226
♪ We slow for no one ♪

00:05:49.685 --> 00:05:55.399
♪ We go where no one goes ♪

00:05:56.567 --> 00:06:01.572
♪ We slow for no one ♪

00:06:03.324 --> 00:06:10.164
♪ We go where no one goes ♪

00:06:10.248 --> 00:06:17.088
♪ We go where no one goes ♪

